[gd_scene load_steps=49 format=3]

; Art pass (D102): a green grassland island (Tiny Swords) replaces the flat
; beige Kenney floor/walls. See src/environment/ground_detail.gd,
; src/environment/foam_ring.gd, src/environment/tree_grove.gd and
; src/environment/sheep_flock.gd for the generated pieces, and
; assets/third_party/tiny_swords/PROVENANCE.md's `Derived/` rows for the
; two cropped ground tiles. ArenaBounds' collision is untouched.
;
; Rich-biome pass (author's brief: "a RICH, LUSH GRASSLAND biome"): three
; raised grass plateaus (src/environment/elevation_plateau.gd), three
; inland ponds with a bridge crossing (src/environment/pond_field.gd), a
; goblin camp, a gold mine, a knights' house and a ruined outpost (hand-
; placed below, animated where the sheet allows via
; src/environment/animated_prop.gd), denser rim forests and sparse lone
; trees, and clustered ground clutter and grazing flocks. Every new site's
; exact coordinates are chosen here (not rolled) so the map reads as
; hand-authored; the organic shoreline/silhouette jitter within each site
; still comes from KeyedRng. See each script's own header for why.

