; Organic sand: a few free patches and a coastal ring around the whole
; island. See src/environment/ground_detail.gd. The Tower plaza and every
; path used to live here too; they are now SandNetwork below (supervisor
; review, this session -- see that script's own header).
[node name="GroundDetail" type="TileMapLayer" parent="."]
texture_filter = 1
script = ExtResource("6_grounddetail")
flat_tilemap_texture = ExtResource("7_flattilemap")

; The Tower plaza, every landmark clearing and every connecting path
; (including the bridge crossing), as one smooth Polygon2D + Line2D shape.
; See src/environment/sand_network.gd's own header for why this replaced
; tile-stamped circles/paths this session.
