; The bridge (biome brief: "one crossed by a bridge on a path"), spanning
; PondField.pond_centers[0]'s narrow north-south neck (axes (230, 115), so
; the path crossing at x=300 sees a gap of roughly 2*115=230px, plus up to
; ~16% shoreline jitter). Bridge_All.png's row-0 frame (region 0,0,192,64)
; is a complete horizontal deck with end posts; rotated 90 degrees so the
; deck runs north-south along SandNetwork's bridge_crossing_target path,
; and scaled on its local X (pre-rotation) axis to comfortably cover that
; gap with a little overlap onto both banks. Placed last so it draws over
; PondField's water/foam wherever they meet.
[node name="Bridge" type="Sprite2D" parent="."]
texture_filter = 1
position = Vector2(300, 950)
rotation_degrees = 90.0
scale = Vector2(1.4, 1.15)
z_index = 0
texture = ExtResource("22_bridgetex")
region_enabled = true
region_rect = Rect2(0, 0, 192, 64)
